@C-58358: Additionally, the user submitted a screenshot, but the screenshot contains comments from other accounts and is unrelated to this case, so it does not constitute counter-evidence.
@C-21355: Conclusion: Uphold the original verdict, limit traffic for 3 days. Double-sided checks are consistent.
